---
manual: art.fill.subsequent_shapes
lines: [1684, 1686]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $blue = blue
  $red = red
  fill $blue
  @before = oval 0, 0, 10
  fill $red
  @after = oval 20, 0, 10
end
----------- test code
assert_equal $red, oval("@after").fill, "a shape drawn after fill carries that fill"
assert_equal $blue, oval("@before").fill, "a shape drawn earlier keeps its own"
